{"id":"wb-3-37","name":"中共中央中原局旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"竹沟革命纪念馆","text":"竹沟革命纪念馆，即中共中央中原局旧址，位于中国河南省驻马店市确山县西30公里的竹沟镇延安街。\n\n始建于1956年。此馆馆名由周恩来题写，纪念中国共产党当时誉为“小延安”的重要根据地。1988年，被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第三批全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n纪念馆内陈列共分六大部分，分别是早期革命活动、开辟豫南桐柏山区根据地、河南抗战的领导中心、中原抗战的战略支撑点、竹沟惨案以及夺取抗战的最后胜利。展品共计400余件，绘制场景4处，大型雕塑作品4件。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%AB%B9%E6%B2%9F%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD%E7%BA%AA%E5%BF%B5%E9%A6%86","revisionId":93944780,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93944780","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4aa201ef7baff8e57188530f.jpg","title":"20251003_Former_Site_of_the_Central_Plains_Bureau_of_the_CPC_Central_Committee_05.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20251003_Former_Site_of_the_Central_Plains_Bureau_of_the_CPC_Central_Committee_05.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/20251003_Former_Site_of_the_Central_Plains_Bureau_of_the_CPC_Central_Committee_05.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​确山 中共中央中原局旧址","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}